  "task_scope": "正式语料连续窗口盲抽取；事件数量和边界未知。",
  "source_segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0002",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 2,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0002",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：00：17：23"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0003",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 3,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0003",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：这个时候部队又到西北去剿共嘛，商震不愿意去，就回到了邢台，召开三个师的师长还有参谋长（参加）的会议，这个时候王兴纲同志就随着商震一块到了邢台。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0004",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 4,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0004",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：01：07：12"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0005",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 5,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0005",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：这个时候我又跟王兴纲见了面了，见了面我就跟他讲，我说：“多少次想跟你联系联系不上。我要参加共产党！他妈个逼这个《何梅协定》像个话嘛，我们这个军队像个什么军队？他妈了个逼见了日本人都跑了，太丢人了嘛！”另外我说国民党这个腐败呀（太严重），我说我要参加共产党。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0006",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 6,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0006",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：02：05：20"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0007",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 7,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0007",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：王兴纲同志说：“你早已是我心目中的共产党员。”因为这个秘密的共产党员呢，你不可能进行别的教育，也不能给看书，书那个时候也没有。所以他说我早已是党员了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0008",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 8,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0008",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "记者：在他心目中您早就是了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0009",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 9,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0009",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：早就是了，他说他同意了。秘密党员都是单线联系嘛，他就（自己）发展的，就没有什么支部通过，就是（口头）说了算嘛。但是他说都还是要得到省委以上的机关批准嘛。那个时候我们跟国民党的关系就有联系了嘛。我们要发展党员，发展党员的条件要特种兵连长以上，步兵是营长以上的才能发展。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0010",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 10,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0010",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "记者：那您在入党时间上是什么时间是正式入党？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0011",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 11,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0011",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：原来我写两个时间嘛，原来是（19）37年，以后我又见了王兴纲，他说：“1936年我那个时候就算通过了嘛，也就是他们批准的时间不算，就算当初我们见面的时候，1936年嘛！”"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0012",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 12,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0012",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：04：30：18"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0013",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 13,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0013",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：所以他说：“你可以写信，写个申请把它改过来。”我说一定是在抗战以前嘛， （19）37年是他告诉我的时间，我以后写的都是（19）37年嘛。我说算了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0014",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 14,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0014",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：05：11：19"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0015",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 15,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0015",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：那个时候文化大革命也没有这个情绪，总政机关也不能够正常（工作）。我觉得挺麻烦的，我又没找（相关部分改正），所以我有的材料原来都填（19）37年，上半年嘛，就“七七事变”以前入党的，我以后都改过来（19）36年嘛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0016",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 16,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0016",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "记者：（之前在讲）1937年“卢沟桥事件”爆发之前，就是抗战爆发之前，今天咱们就讲这个抗战以后。“七七事变”现在说是抗战爆发的开始。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0017",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 17,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0017",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：对对。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0018",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 18,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0018",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "记者：当时你们怎么知道的这个事情？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0019",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 19,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0019",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：06：13：23"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0020",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 20,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0020",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：“七七事变”的时候，我们正在邢台。那个时候我是还在32军特务团，我那个时候已经是炮兵团七连的连长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0021",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 21,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0021",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：07：01：08"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0022",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 22,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0022",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：大家那个时候听说29军在卢沟桥抗击日本人，大家都非常地兴奋，非常地高兴！大家都来赞扬29军。这之后程潜当了第一战区的司令长官，商震就当了20集团军的总司令，就指挥平汉路战争。我最初的时候就把32军从邢台这儿一下子转移到冀中，集结待命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0023",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 23,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0023",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：08：34：14"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0024",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 24,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0024",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：炮兵团跟军部在一起都到了冀中。这个时候32军的141师就在大概国民党“双十节”之前十几天，就是9月底十月初，部队就接触上了。32军在石家庄北边的正定，141师的一个团在那儿抗击日军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0025",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 25,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0025",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：09：41：23"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0026",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 26,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0026",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：那个时候这个团大部分都是我们河北军事政治学校的老师啊、队长啊、同学啊，团长就是步兵大队队长，另外底下营长、连长大部分都是我们的同学。结果团长也牺牲了，同时13个连长牺牲了12个，另外两个营长负了重伤，其中一个还是共产党员呢，也是我们的同学，叫王启明。以后就是（19）46年在豫北起义，那个时候他是32军的参谋长了，想带两个团起义。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0027",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 27,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0027",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：11：06：20"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0028",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 28,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0028",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：两个团一个是团长一个是进步分子，但是队伍带不动啊，都不愿再打仗啊，结果就带着一个侦察连起义了，到我们这儿就给陈、谢，就是陈赓跟谢富治那个兵团当参谋长。以后在云南当省区副司令。他也在正定受了重伤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0029",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 29,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0029",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "记者：陈老，那平汉线这一仗为什么打得损失这么大？是战斗力不行还是武器装备不行？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0030",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 30,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0030",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：12：23：12"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0031",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 31,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0031",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：爱国的思想都是挺坚定的，打仗也很勇敢的，就是装备落后！我们那个时候就是有一个机枪、步枪、重机关枪、迫击炮，就这么些装备，那个时候那个炮兵还没用得上。 "
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0032",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 32,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0032",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：13：18：23"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0033",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 33,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0033",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：因为商震他是很爱国的，所以这个部队作风也很正派的，战斗力还是很不错的。打那里一仗以后，敌人到石家庄，不想到山西去，就打那个地方，我们也没守备，他到那个地方过一下子就继续向南了。我们就在元氏县抵抗。"
